       the portal shell. On mobile (≤768px) the studio takes over the
       full viewport, so the user needs an Exit affordance — keep it
       visible there and override its click to return to /pages/welcome
       (handled by the inline script below).
     The standalone /pages/ninja-design-studio page and PDP modal flows are
     unaffected because they aren't inside .mp-ajax-content. */
  .mp-ajax-content .studio-logo {
